{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to our Alpha Demo! This game is still a work in progress. Feel free to leave feedback in the forum and our discord!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ditch the roles, hard counters and last hits in Sirocco, in a new MOBA inspired by the beloved Warcraft 3 mod: Battleships. Rally your team as you <strong>swap abilities</strong> mid-match, load up <strong>auto-firing weapons</strong>, and craft strategies on the fly. No rules \u2014 just fun. <br> <br>Join the Discord and request access to Playtest Now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488650/extras/Creativityasmeta.png?t=1740709601\" />  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Creativity As Meta </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Without fixed roles and hard counters, learn as you go and discover your own strategies instead of being punished for not following the strategies of others. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488650/extras/LoomCoils.png?t=1740709601\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Auto-firing Arena, Not Farming Arena</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sirocco utilizes an auto-fire mechanic and economic system that promotes team fighting and positioning over last hitting NPCs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488650/extras/AutoFiring.png?t=1740709601\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>High Risk, High Reward</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every Ability In Sirocco Is A Skill Shot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Deep Strategy, Not Memorization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine specialized weapons, ship abilities, and ability augmentations to develop your own way to play.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Conquer The Five Seas with your Friends by Making New Ones</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Sirocco, teams win, not individuals, so whether you are 10-0 or 0-10, our economic system ensures all your friends are critical to achieving victory.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3488650?t=1740709601","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488650/67d1f8098395d3e3d681aa4ace689da4baa11d84/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740709601","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488650/62af9bff0edacd7e149c9c8d7569345e3ed5944a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740709601","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488650/62af9bff0edacd7e149c9c8d7569345e3ed5944a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740709601","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Naval combat. Captains talk about and refer to use of alcohol and tobacco. Occasional swearing."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to our Alpha Demo! This game is still a work in progress. Feel free to leave feedback in the forum and our discord!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ditch the roles, hard counters and last hits in Sirocco, in a new MOBA inspired by the beloved Warcraft 3 mod: Battleships. Rally your team as you <strong>swap abilities</strong> mid-match, load up <strong>auto-firing weapons</strong>, and craft strategies on the fly. No rules \u2014 just fun. <br> <br>Join the Discord and request access to Playtest Now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488650/extras/Creativityasmeta.png?t=1740709601\" />  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Creativity As Meta </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Without fixed roles and hard counters, learn as you go and discover your own strategies instead of being punished for not following the strategies of others. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488650/extras/LoomCoils.png?t=1740709601\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Auto-firing Arena, Not Farming Arena</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sirocco utilizes an auto-fire mechanic and economic system that promotes team fighting and positioning over last hitting NPCs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488650/extras/AutoFiring.png?t=1740709601\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>High Risk, High Reward</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every Ability In Sirocco Is A Skill Shot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Deep Strategy, Not Memorization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine specialized weapons, ship abilities, and ability augmentations to develop your own way to play.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Conquer The Five Seas with your Friends by Making New Ones</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Sirocco, teams win, not individuals, so whether you are 10-0 or 0-10, our economic system ensures all your friends are critical to achieving victory.</p>","developers":["Lunchbox Entertainment Inc."],"fullgame":{"appid":"2790090","name":"Sirocco"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488650/header.jpg?t=1740709601","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul clas